10,8285,8285.T,三谷産業,3,ok,EQUITY,"Mitani Sangyo Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.mitani.co.jp,"Mitani Sangyo Co., Ltd. engages in chemicals, resin, electronics, information systems, air conditioning systems, housing equipment, and energy businesses in Japan and internationally. It offers inorganic chemicals comprising alkali industry products, ammonia and acid products, water treatment chemicals, and others; organic chemicals, including alcohols, aromatic hydrocarbons, ester, ketones, glycol and ether, and others; pharmaceutical intermediates and active pharmaceutical ingredients; food ingredients, food additives, and feed ingredients; pesticide intermediates, fine chemicals, cosmetic materials and intermediates, calcination of catalyst/carrier granulation, etc.; and use of waste and by-products. The company also provides plastic moldings, including automotive parts, precision parts, appearance trims, original parts, special moldings; assembled substrates, and electronic parts; and dies. In addition, it offers system integration services; package software; hardware maintenance; infrastructure solutions, such as network, security, platform, and mail system; data center services; and support and operation service for systems. Further, the company is involved in the construction of air conditioning, sanitary plumbing, and special facilities construction, as well as other special technical construction; and renovation activities, as well as kitchen and bathroom products, storage unit equipment, and air conditioning equipment under the INTENZA brand. Additionally, it offers petroleum products; LPG gas; and new energy products. Mitani Sangyo Co., Ltd. was founded in 1928 and is headquartered in Kanazawa, Japan.",48517283840,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.mitani.co.jp,
