10,8331,8331.T,千葉銀,3,ok,EQUITY,"The Chiba Bank, Ltd.",Financial Services,Banks - Regional,https://www.chibabank.co.jp,"The Chiba Bank, Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, provides banking products and services in Japan and internationally. It offers time, installment time, and foreign currency deposits; loan products, such as home, card, car, education, home renovation, personal, and other loans; credit and debit cards; and asset management products, including investment trusts, NISA, Walthnavi, public debt, defined contribution pension plan, and other asset management products. The company also provides insurance products comprising pension insurance, whole life insurance, medical insurance and cancer insurance, long-term care and dementia insurance, disability insurance, term life insurance, and endowment insurance; and testamentary trust and estate settlement services. In addition, it offers corporate products and services comprising fundraising business portal, Web-EB service, cashless payment, accounting and collection rationalization service, business and management support, and business succession support; internet services, foreign exchange services, and safe deposit boxes. Further, the company holds securities consisting of bonds, stocks, and investment trusts for investment and operating purposes. The Chiba Bank, Ltd. was incorporated in 1943 and is based in Chiba, Japan.",1977708445696,JPY,,ok,https://www.chibabank.co.jp,千葉銀行
10,8334,8334.T,群馬銀,3,ok,EQUITY,"The Gunma Bank, Ltd.",Financial Services,Banks - Regional,https://www.gunmabank.co.jp,"The Gunma Bank, Ltd. provides various banking and financial services in Japan. It operates through Banking and Lease segments. The company offers current, ordinary, savings, fixed, separate, and foreign currency deposits; negotiable certificates of deposit; loans on bills and deeds, as well as overdrafts; discounts on bank acceptance, commercial bills, and documentary bills; domestic exchange transactions comprising transfers and debt collection; and foreign exchange transaction services, such as exports, imports, and foreign remittances. It also trades in public bonds, including national government bonds; and invests in government and municipal bonds, corporate bonds, stocks, and other securities for bank reserves and fund management. In addition, the company provides over-the-counter sales of national government bonds and investment trusts; leasing; services as a trustee of bonds and an issuing and paying agent; and trust services for testamentary substitute, land, real estate management, specific charitable, and charitable public trusts, as well as inheritance-related services, including testamentary trust and estate liquidation services. Further, it engages in the handling of defined contribution pension plans and commercial papers; agency services for pension trusts, non-life and life insurance, and others; and safe deposit box, securities dealing and lending, loan guarantees, financial instruments brokerage, underwriting of public bonds, and derivative transactions of interest rates and currencies. The Gunma Bank, Ltd. was founded in 1878 and is headquartered in Maebashi, Japan.",1097459761152,JPY,,ok,https://www.gunmabank.co.jp,"ç¾¤é¦¬éè¡ åäººã®ãå®¢ãã¾ æ³äººã®ãå®¢ãã¾ æ ªä¸»ã»æè³å®¶ã®çãã¾ ç¾¤é¦¬éè¡ã«ã¤ãã¦ æ¡ç¨æ å ± English ã­ã°ã¤ã³ ã¤ã³ã¿ã¼ããããã³ã­ã³ã° ã­ã°ã¤ã³ æ°è¦ç³è¾¼ã»ãµã