10,8630,8630.T,8630.T,5,ok,EQUITY,"Sompo Holdings, Inc.",Financial Services,Insurance - Property & Casualty,https://www.sompo-hd.com,"Sompo Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides property and casualty (P&C) insurance products and services in Japan and internationally. It operates through Domestic P&C Insurance Business, Overseas Insurance Business, Domestic Life Insurance Business, Nursing Care Business, and Other segments. The company offers small-amount and short-term insurance products. It also provides life insurance; defined contribution pension fund management services; services for security, health, and wellbeing; business continuity management and planning, enterprise risk management, and cybersecurity services; comprehensive healthcare services; nursing care; risk consulting; helpdesk and arrangement services for solutions; consultation and support services for health, caregiving, retirement funds, and work-care balance; investment advisory and management services; and research and consulting services. In addition, the company engages in the sale of investment trusts; and planning, development, sale, operation support, and maintenance services for welfare operations support software. Further, it is involved in the insurance agency, extended warranty, digital-related, asset management, and other businesses. The company was formerly known as Sompo Japan Nipponkoa Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to Sompo Holdings, Inc. in October 2016. Sompo Holdings, Inc. was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan.",6079795691520,JPY,,ok,https://www.sompo-hd.com | https://www.sompo-hd.com/company/ | https://www.sompo-hd.com/group/,"ＳＯＭＰＯホールディングス このページの本文へ移動します English 検索 企業情報 グループ事業 株主・投資家の皆さま ニュース・トピックス サステナビリティ 採用情報 Highlights 2027年3月期第1四半期決算発表 2026年5月22日開催 IRミーティング 「統合レポート2026」の発行 最新情報 2026年09月04日 人事異動のお知らせ( PDF/83KB) 2026年09月03日 自己株式の取得状況に関するお知らせ( PDF/85KB) 2026年08月28日 「統合レポート２０２６」ならびに「業績・コーポレートデータレポート２０２６」の発行［トピックス］( PDF/138KB)