10,8789,8789.T,8789.T,1,ok,EQUITY,FinTech Global Incorporated,Financial Services,Financial Conglomerates,https://www.fgi.co.jp,"FinTech Global Incorporated provides various financial services in Japan. The company offers investment banking, including financial arrangements, financial advisory services, and consulting services on public accounting system implementation; documentation support services for public facility management; real estate asset management and aviation business, such as aircraft technology services, remarketing of aircraft/engines, and aircraft operating lease. It also engages in public accounting and public facilities management support activities; sale of public accounting software; consulting and system configuration, and operation services related to asset management of networked infrastructure; planning, design, configuration, maintenance, operation, and management of information processing systems for infrastructure and utilities; consulting for information processing systems, including data collection, recording, conversion, updating and management, and applied in database creation; and sale and rental of computers, peripheral equipment, communication devices, and software packages and services. In addition, the company engages in the real estate development, purchase and sale, exchange, leasing, management, agency, brokerage, and consulting services; internet-based information services business; and planning, operation, and management of websites. Further, it operates and manages a theme park. FinTech Global Incorporated was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Shinagawa, Japan.",30612434944,JPY,,ok,https://www.fgi.co.jp | https://www.fgi.co.jp/business | https://www.fgi.co.jp/about,"FGI - FinTech Global Incorporated お問い合わせ 採用情報 Jp En 事業案内 事業案内 投資銀行業務 投資業務 投資運用業務 地域課題ソリューション 企業情報 企業情報 トップメッセージ 会社概要・沿革 グループ会社一覧 コーポレートガバナンス FGIグループ行動規範 役員情報 組織図 経営基本方針 コンプライアンス体制 IR情報 IR情報 IRニュース 経営方針 IRライブラリー 業績・財務情報 株主・株式情報 IRカレンダー IRサポート ニュース サステナ