10,8887,8887.T,8887.T,3,ok,EQUITY,"SYLA Holdings Co., Ltd.",Real Estate,Real Estate - Development,https://syla-holdings.jp,"SYLA Holdings Co., Ltd., through its subsidiaries, primarily develops, constructs, sells, and manages apartments in Japan. The company engages in the land purchase, design, construction, operation, and maintenance of solar power plants. It also provides real estate leasing, management, and brokerage services, as well as real estate crowdfunding services on the Rimawari-kun platform. In addition, the company offers a system that automatically collects various real estate data online, develops real estate investment, machine learning algorithms, RPA, and business systems using this system. Further, the company provides consulting on business automation and AI system implementation for corporations; real estate investment and asset management; operates and sells renewable energy-related products; and sells and maintains solar and biomass power generation equipment. Additionally, the company engages in electricity brokerage, sale of electricity, renewable energy trading, and trade brokerage activities. SYLA Holdings Co., Ltd. was founded in 1970 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",13547610112,JPY,,ok,https://syla-holdings.jp | https://syla-holdings.jp/company/detail | https://syla-holdings.jp/business/real_estate,"株式会社シーラホールディングス - SYLA Holdings Co.,ltd. 株式会社シーラホールディングス COMPANY 会社概要 役員紹介 企業理念 BUSINESS 総合不動産事業 建設事業 不動産テック事業 再生可能エネルギー事業 その他事業 開発物件一覧 IR 投資家の皆様へ 株式情報 IRニュース 電子公告 業績サマリー 免責事項 株価情報 ディスクロージャーポリシー NEWS RECRUIT CONTACT プライバシーポリシー 特定商取引法に基づく表示 お取引先様の通報窓口について COMPANY 企業情報 COMPANY 会社概要 BOARD MEMBER 役員紹介 PHILOSOPHY 企業理念 BUSINESS 事業内容 REAL ESTATE 総合不動産事業 CONSTRUCTION 建設事業 PROP-TECH 不動産テック事業 SUSTAINABLE ENERGY 再生可能エネルギー事業 OTHER BUSINESS その他事業 PROPERTY MAP 開発物件一覧 NEWS お知らせ IR 投資家情報 TOP IRトップ MESSAGE 投資家の皆様へ STOCK INFORMATION 株式情報 IR NEWS IRニュース ELECTRIC PUBLIC NOTICE 電子公告 PERFORMANCE SUMMARY 業績サマリー DISCLAIMER 免責事項 STOCK PRICE INFORMATION 株価情報 DI