10,9023,9023.T,9023.T,3,ok,EQUITY,"Tokyo Metro Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Railroads,https://www.tokyometro.jp/index.html,"Tokyo Metro Co., Ltd. engages in the operation and management of railways in Japan. It is involved in the urban design and lifestyle creation businesses. The company also manages shops at stations and other commercial facilities; develops and rents office buildings and hotels; and provides advertising media services, such as advertisements in stations, premises and trains, and an information and communications business that handles licensing of mobile phone communication services, as well as leases optical fiber cable, etc. The company was formerly known as Teito Rapid Transit Authority and changed its name to Tokyo Metro Co., Ltd. in 2004. The company was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",868572921856,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.tokyometro.jp/index.html,
10,9024,9024.T,9024.T,5,ok,EQUITY,Seibu Holdings Inc.,Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.seibuholdings.co.jp,"Seibu Holdings Inc. engages in the urban transportation, hotel and leisure, real estate, construction, and baseball team management businesses in Japan and internationally. It operates through Urban Transportation and Railway Business, Hotel and Leisure Business, Real Estate Business, and Others segments. The company offers railway, bus, and taxi transportation services; and operates hotels, hot springs and spas, golf club and courses, ski resorts, tennis courts, bowling alleys, skating rinks, fitness clubs, and other leisure facilities. It also develops and sells detached houses, condominiums, and custom-built houses, and resort properties; leases office and residential facilities; and develops and operates stores in train stations, shopping malls, and other commercial facilities. In addition, the company maintains a professional baseball team under the Saitama Seibu Lions name; hosts concerts and other non-baseball events through Belluna Dome; and operates and manages amusement parks, aquariums, movie theaters, and pools. Further, it offers fire insurance, automobile insurance, travel insurance, and life insurance products; home and urban development services; pet care products; and builds cemeteries. Additionally, the company operates cram school for elementary school students; drive-in facilities; rest areas; toll roads; car and bicycle parking lots. Seibu Holdings Inc. was incorporated in 2006 and is headquartered in Toshima, Japan.",893434920960,JPY,,ok,https://www.seibuholdings.co.jp,"西武ホールディングス | でかける人を、ほほえむ人へ。 採用情報 EN グループ情報 SEIBU PRINCE CLUB ✖ 閉じる グループ情報 西武グループ トップメッセージ グループビジョン サービス紹介 西武グループの歴史 企業一覧 西武グループのさまざまな取り組み 西武ホールディングス 会社概要 組織図 役員紹介 コーポレートガバナンス 統合報告書/アニュアルレポート 西武塾 西武ロケーション サービス ブルーインキュベーション 新規事業/投資 シニアほほえみ プロジェクト ペットスマイル プロジェクト サステナビリティアクション ✖ 閉じる サステナビリティアクション サステナビリティマネジメント 脱炭素・資源有効活用 住みたいまち・訪れたいまちづくり 五感を揺さぶる体験創造 安全・安心なサービス提供 多様な人財の育成