10,9044,9044.T,9044.T,5,ok,EQUITY,"NANKAI Co., Ltd.",Real Estate,Real Estate - Development,https://www.nankai.co.jp,"NANKAI Co., Ltd. operates as a railway company in Japan. It operates through Transportation Business, Real Estate Business, Distribution Business, Leisure and Services Business, Construction Business, and Other Business segment. The Transportation business operates railways, tramways, and buses, as well as ocean freight, cargo transportation, and vehicle maintenance business. The Real Estate business leases commercial and office buildings, condominiums, facilities under elevated railway facilities, parking lots, etc. The Distribution business manages shopping centers, convenience stores, dining and drinking establishments, station stores, lottery stores, and retail stores. The Leisure and Services segment is involved in the travel agency business; rental of motorboat racing facilities; and operates hotels and ryokan Japanese inns. This segment also offers funeral services; building management and maintenance; and other services. The Construction segment involved in the general construction, civil engineering, architecture, and electrical work. The company was formerly known as Nankai Electric Railway Co., Ltd. and changed its name to NANKAI Co., Ltd. in April 2026. NANKAI Co., Ltd. was founded in 1884 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan.",337042014208,JPY,,ok,https://www.nankai.co.jp | https://www.nankai.co.jp/company.html | https://www.nankai.co.jp/traffic/newticketless/about.html,"NANKAI・南海電鉄｜公共交通事業・まちづくり/不動産事業 企業情報 IR情報 採用情報 よくあるご質問 Language English 繁体中文 简体中文 한국 English 日本語 English 簡体中文 繁体中文 한국 検索 キーワードで検索 検索する 運行情報 閉じる 検索 閉じる メニュー 閉じる 運行情報 運行情報 更新 運行状況詳細 遅延証明 キーワードで検索 検索する 電車に乗る まちとつながる 電車に乗る TOP もっと安心・快適に ダイヤ検索 駅・時刻表（路線から） 駅・時刻表（50音から） 振替輸送 バリアフリー施設 お忘れ物 駅・電車のマナー 介助申し込み 路線図 運賃検索 チケットレスサービス 女性専用車両 企業情報 IR情報 採用情報 お問い合わせ NANKAI・南海電鉄公式 TOP Language English 繁体中文 简体中文 한국 English 日本語 English 簡体中文 繁体中文 한국 まちとつながる TOP 路線からまちを探す 企業情報 IR情報 採用情報 お問い合わせ NANK