10,9142,9142.T,9142.T,6,ok,EQUITY,Kyushu Railway Company,Industrials,Conglomerates,https://www.jrkyushu.co.jp,"Kyushu Railway Company engages in the railway business in Japan. The company operates through five segments: Transportation Services, Construction, Real Estate & Hotels, Retail & Food Service, and Business Services. The Transportation segment involved in railway and bus businesses, including shared, highway, and chartered bus business. The Construction segment offers construction, vehicle equipment and machinery-related operations, electrical work, civil engineering, railways maintenance, and construction consulting services, as well as engages in public and private construction business. The Real Estate and Hotels segment leases station buildings and other real estate; sells condominiums and other properties; and conducts hotel operations, etc. The Retail and Restaurant segment involved in retail, restaurant, and agriculture businesses, as well as operates Meihingura specialist souvenir shops and FamilyMart convenience stores. The Business Services segment sales, maintains, and rents construction machinery, such as diesel engines, generators, etc., as well as involved in wholesaling, cleaning, advertising, system-related, and other businesses. It also provides passenger railway, ferry, travel agency, parking, property management, and non-life and other insurance services; and retail sales of travel goods, food and drink, pharmaceuticals, etc. Kyushu Railway Company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Fukuoka City, Japan.",550725287936,JPY,,ok,https://www.jrkyushu.co.jp,"﻿ 九州旅客鉄道株式会社 Web会員ログイン Web会員 ログイン お問い合わせ／お忘れ物 お手伝いが必要なお客さまへ Language English 簡体中文 繁体中文 한국어 メニュー 鉄道・きっぷの予約・旅行 戻る 鉄道・きっぷの予約・旅行 鉄道・きっぷの予約・旅行TOP 運行情報 時刻・運賃検索 運賃・料金改定のお知らせ きっぷのルール 列車予約 JR九州インターネット列車予約 スマートEX エクスプレス予約 LINEからEX 割引きっぷ MaaS（デジタルチケット） my routeで買える デジタルチケット 定期券運賃検索 定期券運賃検索 JR九州アプリ 駅情報 路線図 荷物輸送 JR九州の列車たち（D&S列車） 36ぷらす3 或る列車 かんぱち・いちろく 駅設備 受動喫煙防止の取り組み スマートサポートステーション 路線図 お忘れ物の